      "content": "it's more than just being sad though. it's like the person i was... that person is actually dead. i look in the mirror and i don't recognize the eyes looking back. it's like i'm just a shell or a placeholder for someone who isn't here anymore. i'm just going through the motions because i have to, but there's nobody actually home. it feels pointless to keep trying to build something when the foundation is just... gone.",
